outputs/*.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Behavioral benchmark data = full attack prompts (regenerable via 16_prepare_behavioral_benchmark.py).
# Keep local-only, like outputs/ (responsible handling, plan §5.6/§17). Aggregates live in the docs.
data/behavioral_benchmark/

# --- Artifact preservation (CAUSAL_CONTINUATION_MASTER_PLAN.md §2.2) ---
# Commit the small, irreplaceable evidence; archive the bulk (raw.jsonl, gens.jsonl, *.npz/*.pt).
!outputs/
outputs/**
!outputs/**/
!outputs/**/summary.json
!outputs/**/*summary*.json
# derived analysis results (loose top-level JSONs) are paper artifacts - keep them
!outputs/*.json
# ...but these two embed prompt text
outputs/RESULT1_transplant_example_prompts.json
outputs/next3_fc_patchscope_bomb.json
!outputs/**/RUNMETA.json
!outputs/**/DONE.json
# ...but NEVER commit attack suffixes or generated text.
outputs/**/gens.jsonl
outputs/**/*suffix*
outputs/gcg/gcg_asr_summary_temporal_lex.json

